description: "Query: tpch_q5"
---
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |  Sort: revenue DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |   Projection: pg.public.nation.n_name, sum(pg.public.lineitem.l_extendedprice * Int64(1) - pg.public.lineitem.l_discount) AS revenue                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[pg.public.nation.n_name]], aggr=[[sum(pg.public.lineitem.l_extendedprice * (Int64(1) - pg.public.lineitem.l_discount))]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |       Inner Join:  Filter: pg.public.nation.n_regionkey = pg.public.region.r_regionkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |         Inner Join:  Filter: pg.public.supplier.s_nationkey = pg.public.nation.n_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |           Inner Join:  Filter: pg.public.lineitem.l_suppkey = pg.public.supplier.s_suppkey AND pg.public.customer.c_nationkey = pg.public.supplier.s_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |             Inner Join:  Filter: pg.public.lineitem.l_orderkey = pg.public.orders.o_orderkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |               Inner Join:  Filter: pg.public.customer.c_custkey = pg.public.orders.o_custkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |                 TableScan: pg.public.customer projection=[c_custkey, c_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |                 TableScan: pg.public.orders projection=[o_orderkey, o_custkey], full_filters=[pg.public.orders.o_orderdate >= CAST(Utf8("1994-01-01") AS Date32), pg.public.orders.o_orderdate < CAST(Utf8("1995-01-01") AS Date32)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |               TableScan: pg.public.lineitem projection=[l_orderkey, l_suppkey, l_extendedprice, l_discount]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |             TableScan: pg.public.supplier projection=[s_suppkey, s_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |           TableScan: pg.public.nation projection=[n_nationkey, n_name, n_regionkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |         TableScan: pg.public.region projection=[r_regionkey], full_filters=[pg.public.region.r_name = Utf8("ASIA")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=postgres compute_context=host=Tcp("benchmarking-postgres-rw.dataplatform.svc.cluster.local"),port=5432,db=tpch_sf1,user=postgres, base_sql=SELECT "n_name", sum(("lineitem"."l_extendedprice" * (1 - "lineitem"."l_discount"))) AS "revenue" FROM "public"."customer" INNER JOIN "public"."orders" ON (("customer"."c_custkey" = "orders"."o_custkey") AND (("orders"."o_orderdate" >= CAST('1994-01-01' AS DATE)) AND ("orders"."o_orderdate" < CAST('1995-01-01' AS DATE)))) INNER JOIN "public"."lineitem" ON ("lineitem"."l_orderkey" = "orders"."o_orderkey") INNER JOIN "public"."supplier" ON (("lineitem"."l_suppkey" = "supplier"."s_suppkey") AND ("customer"."c_nationkey" = "supplier"."s_nationkey")) INNER JOIN "public"."nation" ON ("supplier"."s_nationkey" = "nation"."n_nationkey") INNER JOIN "public"."region" ON (("nation"."n_regionkey" = "region"."r_regionkey") AND ("region"."r_name" = 'ASIA')) GROUP BY "nation"."n_name" ORDER BY "revenue" DESC NULLS FIRST |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
